` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"f936bba363f68a6238a96102ad7aa687","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"63d74a53d198b4412698fa311a39b42f","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"5af2d9010760e0d10ea5fb515590b623","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c2a4b0d2d95fdec93cc8856393f1344b","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"61747fe13c6369d518062c470dc8757f","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"6d172cf69c4b9b121f50a8925366b14a","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"b8d22e177a5c3efcf74015613d7b8f0f","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"f96b46875ba44621372c7d18edf0a80d","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"dfb600edb68ffc97f44fddb783033407","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794843593687,"stop":1794843593790,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":"a